==Battleground==
*100 [[Snache]]s spawn after 10.67 seconds<sup>320f</sup>, delay 6.67~16 seconds<sup>200f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 23.33~33.33 seconds<sup>700f~1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*100 [[Squire Rel]]s (200%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*150 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~13.33 seconds<sup>100f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**200 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 3.33~40 seconds<sup>100f~1,200f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 0.07~2 seconds<sup>2f~60f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Le'boin]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle by sending out [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cats]] to stall the B.B.Bunnies, meanwhile upgrade your [[Worker Cat]]. Once the enemies will start beating your castle, spam meatshields, [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Brave Cats]] and [[Bean Cats (Special Cat)|Brah Cats]].

When Kang Roo and Gory come, things become serious. Hopefully, you already managed to kill B.B.Bunnies by the time they showed up. If you did, then spawn [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]]. Don't forget to protect him with meatshields.

Once you kill Kang Roo, money won't be such a problem anymore. Spend that money wisely, by spawning meatshields, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cats]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and Mythical Titan Cats. When you hit the enemies' base, the player will need to have at least 2 Mythical Titan Cats. Now you will need to deal with a big problem - 3 Le'boins. Luckily, Kang Roos will give you a lot of money. Just keep spamming meatshields, Sexy Legs Cats, UFO Cats, Dragon Cats, Mythical Titan Cats.

